<title>USA: Donnkenny president, CEO resigns.</title>
<headline>Donnkenny president, CEO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Donnkenny Inc said on Wednesday Richard Rubin has resigned as president and chief executive, as well as from the company's board of directors.</p>
<p>Donnkenny also said it has elected Harvey Appelle as chairman of the board at a special meeting.</p>
